The complete configuration of an ${fref("journeys/programming-language-theory/concepts/abstract-machine.td")} at a point during evaluation, comprising the current term and any auxiliary data (e.g., ${fref("journeys/programming-language-theory/concepts/environment.td")}, store, stack). In ${fref("journeys/programming-language-theory/concepts/pure-untyped-lambda-calculus.td")}, the state is simply a ${fref("journeys/programming-language-theory/concepts/lambda-term.td")}.
